.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-mcp-posture 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-mcp\-posture \- Refuse an enabled MCP server this session did not attach, or a grant the connector would still prompt for
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten mcp posture\fR [\fB\-\-settings\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-logs\fR] [\fB\-\-spawns\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Refuse an enabled MCP server this session did not attach, or a grant the connector would still prompt for
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-settings\fR \fI<settings>\fR
The permission settings file to judge, instead of the declared one
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<config>\fR
The host\-injected MCP config to resolve server names through
.TP
\fB\-\-logs\fR \fI<logs>\fR
The host\*(Aqs MCP connection log tree, instead of the one it keeps for this project
.TP
\fB\-\-spawns\fR \fI<spawns>\fR
The spawn ledger `mcp spawn` appends to, instead of this clone\*(Aqs
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
